"""Machine-readable effect for every card: id -> (stat id, kind, scale). The value at a stack is values_by_stack[n-1] * scale.

kind "add" adds to the stat, "mult" is a fractional multiplier (+0.04 = +4%), "value" is an absolute number the code reads as it is.
Stats starting with a plain name are used by Stats.gd / combat code; triggers (on hit, on kill...) are read by the code that fires them.
"""
